{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-apocalypse-aa/984664-thread-of-fenris","id":984664,"title":"Thread of Fenris","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","World of Darkness","Werewolf: The Apocalypse"],"posts":[{"date":"2016-10-09T17:20:21-07:00","id":984664,"title":"Thread of Fenris","content":"Because I asked anyone wanting to talk about it to take it to a new thread...<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Uniform Two Six</strong> </div> <div class=\"message\"><span style=\"color:#252C2F\"><span style=\"font-family:Helvetica\"><span style=\"font-size:13px\">'m siding with Prince of the Night on this one. That's how the Get have </span></span></span><i>always</i><span style=\"color:#252C2F\"><span style=\"font-family:Helvetica\"><span style=\"font-size:13px\"> been written.</span></span></span></div> </div> </div> </div><span style=\"color:#252C2F\"><span style=\"font-family:Helvetica\"><span style=\"font-size:13px\"><br /> <br /> There was a sidebar in the Revised tribebook about how a lot of lupus in the tribe saw it as being incredibly dumb and a taint of human society, and it was rather heavily downplayed as a wide standpoint, given that one of the focus characters of the book was a woman. The Swords of Heimdall were also written as being painfully sexist in addition to racists that looked down on lupus, so I think that the intent was to kill this stereotype as dead as possible without massive retcons.<br /> <br /> I, however, do not think that massive retcons are bad, and would love it if the Fenrir were presented as the enemy of all good Norse in their past, like the Black Furies being the enemies of Greek culture.<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> It doesn't have to make logical sense -- it just has to make sense to a bunch of testosterone-laden-jock-douches with superpowers (like pretty much every male Get). You get rid of it (presumably because you want the Garou to be appear so much more noble) </div> </div> </div>Noble? Not unless you think that Norse neopagans need to be chased down and gutted because they're giving homage to old One-Eye. Which is something that the Fenrir probably should be doing, seeing as how he's a great enemy of the past. Sure, it endangers the veil, but you just don't tolerate jackwagons acting as unknowing patsies to an old nemesis going into your territory and invoking his name. In the past, they might have even been very aggressive in killing the original pagans around their territory if they didn't convert - not palling around with Christians, because they would only try to convert them, but actively taking advantage of the weakening position in society to kill them and leave them as a warning to One-Eye. They still kept a lot of festivities for their new syncretism, though, so the Get might not be happy about that.<br /> <br /> This is what we should have. Monstrous fulfillment of an ancient grudge, wrought in blood. Not werewolf Hans and Franz: the tribe, with vaguely-themed camps named for Aesir gods in defiance of the fact that they and Fenris hate each other.<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> you pretty drastically change what the Get of Fenris tribe is thematically. </div> </div> </div></span></span></span><div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> </div> </div> </div>Revised already started the ball rolling. Now there's just the matter of more in-depth research and better mindedness in writing to continue onward. Note that the White Howlers were originally presented as being a tribe of Leeroy Jenkins, but the tribebook changed this. The Silver Fangs, in 2nd edition, had the RUSSIARUSSIARUSSIA button slammed constantly, but even in a book where the chapter headers were in unRomanized Russian, they still found the time to make the tribe an old, continent-spanning institution that had a long history in North Africa, the Middle-East, and most of Asia.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/23-saur-ops-specialist","name":"Saur Ops Specialist","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar23_3.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"9371"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-10-09T17:26:27-07:00","id":984667,"title":"","content":"I find the Swords of Heimdell make good Comic Relief Cannon Fodder Villains.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://imagizer.imageshack.us/a/img829/1897/8seg.png\" target=\"_blank\"><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://imagizer.imageshack.us/a/img829/1897/8seg.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"https://imageshack.com/i/2iw20supportergarou125p\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"https://imageshack.com/i/0j5hz8j\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /></a><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://imageshack.com/i/idnSdTJkj\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"https://i.imgsafe.org/97fd805379.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" />","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1153-prince-of-the-night","name":"Prince of the Night","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"4205"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-10-09T17:42:20-07:00","id":984676,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Prince of the Night</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-apocalypse-aa/984664-thread-of-fenris?p=984667#post984667\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I find the Swords of Heimdell make good Comic Relief Cannon Fodder Villains.</div> </div> </div> </div>No, they're an insidious evil akin to the &quot;First they came...&quot; poem. That;s probably why the Get dealt with them the way that the Get typically do.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/23-saur-ops-specialist","name":"Saur Ops Specialist","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar23_3.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"9371"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-10-09T18:08:28-07:00","id":984691,"title":"","content":"Do you see why I'd see them as good Comic relief?<br /> <br /> One thing that bothers me about that, is I'm not TOTALLY void of racism myself.<br /> <br /> I dont hate black people I dont want to exterminate or enslave them I risked my own life once to save a drowning black boy.<br /> <br /> But in questionable situations, I'm a little less willing to give them the benefit of the doubt.<br /> <br /> Its not at all something I'm proud of, but my upbringing has affected me in the way that it has.<br /> <br /> In that light a way I could still despise the Swords.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://imagizer.imageshack.us/a/img829/1897/8seg.png\" target=\"_blank\"><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://imagizer.imageshack.us/a/img829/1897/8seg.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"https://imageshack.com/i/2iw20supportergarou125p\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"https://imageshack.com/i/0j5hz8j\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /></a><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://imageshack.com/i/idnSdTJkj\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"https://i.imgsafe.org/97fd805379.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" />","edited":{"userid":1153,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1153-prince-of-the-night","user":"Prince of the Night","date":". 10-09-2016, 09:16 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1153-prince-of-the-night","name":"Prince of the Night","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"4205"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-10-09T18:54:28-07:00","id":984705,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Prince of the Night</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-apocalypse-aa/984664-thread-of-fenris?p=984691#post984691\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> But in questionable situations, I'm a little less willing to give them the benefit of the doubt.<br /></div> </div> </div> </div>.....what?<br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1179-celtspz","name":"CeltSPZ","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1179_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"835"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-10-09T19:06:55-07:00","id":984713,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Prince of the Night</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-apocalypse-aa/984664-thread-of-fenris?p=984667#post984667\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I find the Swords of Heimdell make good Comic Relief Cannon Fodder Villains.</div> </div> </div> </div>This is just my own opinion, but a comic relief is probably the last way I'd want to use the Swords of Heimdall.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":3}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1129-sergeant-brother","name":"Sergeant Brother","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1129_3.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1620"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-10-09T19:21:03-07:00","id":984716,"title":"","content":"I made peace with the Idea that the Fenrir were enemies of Odin, but not necessarily all the Aesir, and thus they were allies with Thor and Sturm Spirits.<br /> <br /> I feel they would have benefited from actually say mentioning their Rivalry with Odin More. The revised book makes it sound like Fenris was actually a Lunar Exalt and Odin was a Crazy old Solar and history retold the story as Tribes of Gods fighting. And later Odin was reincarnated as an Abyssal or a Wan Kue if you want to ignore that. And then a Cainite.<br /> <br /> A strong tribal villain like Sutekh was to the Striders would probably help solidify their history more, and thus also their present.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/754-eldagusto","name":"Eldagusto","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar754_2.gif","title":"Banned","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"6435"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-10-09T20:16:26-07:00","id":984729,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>CeltSPZ</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-apocalypse-aa/984664-thread-of-fenris?p=984705#post984705\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> .....what?</div> </div> </div> </div><br /> Im more instinctively on guard if im traveling on foot at night, if a person I see is someone of color.<br /> <br /> on Guard, mind you, not hostile.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://imagizer.imageshack.us/a/img829/1897/8seg.png\" target=\"_blank\"><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://imagizer.imageshack.us/a/img829/1897/8seg.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"https://imageshack.com/i/2iw20supportergarou125p\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"https://imageshack.com/i/0j5hz8j\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /></a><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://imageshack.com/i/idnSdTJkj\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"https://i.imgsafe.org/97fd805379.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" />","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1153-prince-of-the-night","name":"Prince of the Night","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"4205"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-10-09T20:23:07-07:00","id":984731,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>CeltSPZ</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-apocalypse-aa/984664-thread-of-fenris?p=984705#post984705\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> .....what?</div> </div> </div> </div>Statistics show this is true of most people. Turns out that when you grow up in a Racist country, you have some pretty Racist subconscious behaviours.<br /> <br /> Anyway, back on topic:<br /> <br /> My current character is a Fenrir Ragabash from Minnesota and I spent a lot of time trying to figure out how on earth the State with the highest population of Fenris' Kinfolk has the reputation for being painfully nice and I concluded that being nice is their way of avoiding triggering Frenzy. So he's this nice lovable gym teacher who disembowels fomori with his magical skinning knife Andskotiflar and then goes home to have hot dish with his wife and kids. Also he thinks most if not all of Fenrir Tribal Lore is total BS since it's basically an endless cycle of &quot;We raided this place, killed everyone and repopulated it, then the bloodlines got polluted and they stopped being Fenrir. So we raided the place, killed them all and repopulated it.&quot;","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/707-etherial","name":"etherial","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar707_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"822"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-10-09T20:52:38-07:00","id":984735,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Prince of the Night</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-apocalypse-aa/984664-thread-of-fenris?p=984729#post984729\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> <br /> Im more instinctively on guard if im traveling on foot at night, if a person I see is someone of color.<br /> <br /> on Guard, mind you, not hostile.</div> </div> </div> </div>Yikes, that is way off topic and is very controversial. Let's drop this and talk about the Get of Fenris instead.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":3}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1129-sergeant-brother","name":"Sergeant Brother","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1129_3.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1620"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-10-09T20:59:32-07:00","id":984739,"title":"","content":"Fair enough, could tell it was a dangerous issue to raise but was deeply curious why in that light the Swords still seem so hatable.<br /> <br /> Someone said their not good comic relief, I for some reason cant help but see them as idiotic fratboys, or losers who signed up with the KKK or ANP to give mommy and daddy the Finger.<br /> <br /> As to the Fenrir being Sexist, that is indeed a long standing deeply rooted thing, for good or ill<br /> <br /> and in some books it suggested the garou nation in general was to a lesser degree, and that that is what prompted the formation of the black furies in the first place, but Canon has moved away from that for quite a while.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://imagizer.imageshack.us/a/img829/1897/8seg.png\" target=\"_blank\"><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://imagizer.imageshack.us/a/img829/1897/8seg.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"https://imageshack.com/i/2iw20supportergarou125p\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"https://imageshack.com/i/0j5hz8j\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /></a><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://imageshack.com/i/idnSdTJkj\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"https://i.imgsafe.org/97fd805379.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" />","edited":{"userid":1153,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1153-prince-of-the-night","user":"Prince of the Night","date":". 10-10-2016, 12:07 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1153-prince-of-the-night","name":"Prince of the Night","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"4205"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-10-09T21:28:14-07:00","id":984747,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>etherial</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-apocalypse-aa/984664-thread-of-fenris?p=984731#post984731\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Statistics show this is true of most people. Turns out that when you grow up in a Racist country, you have some pretty Racist subconscious behaviours.<br /> <br /> Anyway, back on topic:<br /> <br /> My current character is a Fenrir Ragabash from Minnesota and I spent a lot of time trying to figure out how on earth the State with the highest population of Fenris' Kinfolk</div> </div> </div> </div>But would it? Would it really? There are a bunch of cultures that have cautionary tales about a wolf-like being swallowing the sun and/or moon. Those could all places that form comparable roots to the tribe or a grouped meta-tribe as the Hakken and Shadow Lords are. The Furies are about the same in that regard, particularly since lots of different places seem to like legends of flying horses. Additionally, few people from a given ethnic extraction are going to be a part of an &quot;associated&quot; tribe, because there are very few Garou and only slightly more kinfolk.<br /> <br /> (Blame the line in Hengeyokai mentioning that Unicorn comes to the Beast Courts as a kirin to support sentai. It got me thinking that the only tribes the need to be in a limited number of places are few and far between, especially since Rage Across Russia had everyone but the Fianna in Russia, and the Silver Fangs have such a widespread distribution in numerous major cultural centers that are not Russia).","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/23-saur-ops-specialist","name":"Saur Ops Specialist","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar23_3.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"9371"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-10-09T23:34:17-07:00","id":984765,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Sergeant Brother</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-apocalypse-aa/984664-thread-of-fenris?p=984713#post984713\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> This is just my own opinion, but a comic relief is probably the last way I'd want to use the Swords of Heimdall.</div> </div> </div> </div>I'd like to see them resurgent in a bale hounds sort of way, like theyre cropping up now in society. Would make for an interesting campaign.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://imageshack.com/a/img829/1897/8seg.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /> WoD-Dark Eras!! (Backed for Viking Age Werewolf)","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1939-lyrics-of-war","name":"Lyrics Of War","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1939_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1769"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-10-10T00:43:54-07:00","id":984776,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Prince of the Night</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-apocalypse-aa/984664-thread-of-fenris?p=984739#post984739\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Fair enough, could tell it was a dangerous issue to raise but was deeply curious why in that light the Swords still seem so hatable.<br /> <br /> Someone said their not good comic relief, I for some reason cant help but see them as idiotic fratboys, or losers who signed up with the KKK or ANP to give mommy and daddy the Finger.<br /> <br /> As to the Fenrir being Sexist, that is indeed a long standing deeply rooted thing, for good or ill<br /> <br /> and in some books it suggested the garou nation in general was to a lesser degree, and that that is what prompted the formation of the black furies in the first place, but Canon has moved away from that for quite a while.</div> </div> </div> </div>As a little anecdote: in our Hengeyokai game we met a Get of Fenris Garou who was basically a bit of a parody of a character another guy once played in one of our Werewolf chronicles and got him out of a bad situation in the Umbra. He basically behaved with stereotypical GoF hubris, arrogance, some sexism and pretty much all of what has been mentioned here. Ever since that day our female Tengu Mirror takes every opportunity that arises to tell everyone we meet what a rude, impolite, arrogant asshole that guy is <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/smile.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Smile\" smilieid=\"1\" class=\"inlineimg\" />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/11694-hexer","name":"Hexer","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar11694_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"93"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-10-10T03:39:19-07:00","id":984799,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Prince of the Night</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-apocalypse-aa/984664-thread-of-fenris?p=984739#post984739\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Someone said their not good comic relief, I for some reason cant help but see them as idiotic fratboys, or losers who signed up with the KKK or ANP to give mommy and daddy the Finger.<br /> <br /> .</div> </div> </div> </div>The problem is that these people aren't funny, ask any victim of a hate crime how funny they are. These sorts of people are dangerous, and through history have done some truly awful stuff (and yes I know you can find hatred and racism in all cultures, but the results are the same). So I guess I don't really look at them as &quot;comic relief&quot; due to the very real things people like them still due today.<br /> <div class=\"b-bbcode b-bbcode__url b-bbcode__url--preview\"> <a href=\"https://www.washingtonpost.com/news/post-nation/wp/2016/09/07/man-accused-of-running-down-black-teen-has-ties-to-a-white-supremacist-prison-gang-authorities-say/?0p19G=c&amp;utm_term=.eedc46c8f022\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"urlimg_container\"> <img class=\"js-img-fallback\" src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/default/google-material/image_placeholder.svg\"> </a> <div class=\"urlinfo\"> <div class=\"title ellipsis\"> <a href=\"https://www.washingtonpost.com/news/post-nation/wp/2016/09/07/man-accused-of-running-down-black-teen-has-ties-to-a-white-supremacist-prison-gang-authorities-say/?0p19G=c&amp;utm_term=.eedc46c8f022\" target=\"_blank\"> </a> </div> <div class=\"url ellipsis\"> <a href=\"https://www.washingtonpost.com/news/post-nation/wp/2016/09/07/man-accused-of-running-down-black-teen-has-ties-to-a-white-supremacist-prison-gang-authorities-say/?0p19G=c&amp;utm_term=.eedc46c8f022\" target=\"_blank\"> https://www.washingtonpost.com/news/post-nation/wp/2016/09/07/man-accused-of-running-down-black-teen-has-ties-to-a-white-supremacist-prison-gang-authorities-say/?0p19G=c&amp;utm_term=.eedc46c8f022 </a> </div> <div class=\"meta\"> </div> </div> </div>","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":6}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1179-celtspz","name":"CeltSPZ","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1179_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"835"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-10-10T11:28:50-07:00","id":984966,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>CeltSPZ</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-apocalypse-aa/984664-thread-of-fenris?p=984799#post984799\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> The problem is that these people aren't funny, ask any victim of a hate crime how funny they are. These sorts of people are dangerous, and through history have done some truly awful stuff (and yes I know you can find hatred and racism in all cultures, but the results are the same). So I guess I don't really look at them as &quot;comic relief&quot; due to the very real things people like them still due today.<br /> <a href=\"https://www.washingtonpost.com/news/post-nation/wp/2016/09/07/man-accused-of-running-down-black-teen-has-ties-to-a-white-supremacist-prison-gang-authorities-say/?0p19G=c&amp;utm_term=.eedc46c8f022\" target=\"_blank\">https://www.washingtonpost.com/news/...=.eedc46c8f022</a></div> </div> </div> </div>The World of Darkness is everything wrong with our world, squared, mixed up with crack, given sturdy supernatural foundations, then planted in a seat in front of a caricature artist with a big chip on their shoulder. You may not laugh at subjects like racism, rape, domestic violence, sexism, elitism, bigotry, gluttony, self-pity, and crippling narcissism... but those topics are seeded throughout the setting as things to be judged, opposed, and the guilty often ridiculed (in Werewolf easily more than any other line). Using disgusting people as objects of mockery is pretty in-tune with the game as-written, IMHO. (Plus, who doesn't enjoy moments like the 'hoods' scene in Django?)<br /> <br /> I think a lot of the rewrites and retcons have tried to make the setting more &quot;The Garou vs The World&quot; where it was previously more of &quot;The Players vs. The Garou AND The World&quot;... personally, I'm not a fan of the change, but that's neither here nor there. I think to goal was to make Garou -less- guilty of the above topics compared to humanity, rather than -more-.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Check out my mediocre WoD/Aeon/Exalted art at <a href=\"http://blackspinel.deviantart.com/\" target=\"_blank\">http://blackspinel.deviantart.com</a> ! It'll make you go &quot;Yup! That's pretty mediocre!&quot;","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12162-crusher-of-cities","name":"Crusher-of-Cities","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar12162_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jul 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"70"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-10-10T12:32:13-07:00","id":985002,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Crusher-of-Cities</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-apocalypse-aa/984664-thread-of-fenris?p=984966#post984966\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> The World of Darkness is everything wrong with our world, squared, mixed up with crack, given sturdy supernatural foundations, then planted in a seat in front of a caricature artist with a big chip on their shoulder. You may not laugh at subjects like racism, rape, domestic violence, sexism, elitism, bigotry, gluttony, self-pity, and crippling narcissism... but those topics are seeded throughout the setting as things to be judged, opposed, and the guilty often ridiculed (in Werewolf easily more than any other line). Using disgusting people as objects of mockery is pretty in-tune with the game as-written, IMHO. (Plus, who doesn't enjoy moments like the 'hoods' scene in Django?)<br /> <br /> I think a lot of the rewrites and retcons have tried to make the setting more &quot;The Garou vs The World&quot; where it was previously more of &quot;The Players vs. The Garou AND The World&quot;... personally, I'm not a fan of the change, but that's neither here nor there. I think to goal was to make Garou -less- guilty of the above topics compared to humanity, rather than -more-.</div> </div> </div> </div>Don't get me wrong, I agree that theses topics are well seeded in the WoD. I use these themes in my games, after all rpgs are a way for some to face issues important to them in a cathartic way. I don't look to hide from these issues in my games. I'mean against the idea of using violent bigots as &quot;comic relief cannon fodder&quot;. It misses the true horror and brutality of hatred. <br /> <br /> These individuals often just hate, and blame, with reason being a useless tool. When violence has been decided on, its usually only thier sense of self interest that can get in the way. Now amp it up with the prowess of a werewolf and you have a rage filled bigot very capable of acting out its wishes and being a predator in every way. The swords aren't villains to be just bumbling oafs. In the case of the swords they are monsters who haven't danced the spiral, so they are that diluted evil that justifies thier hate (&quot;well if they didn't actually that way...&quot;) and sees their view as only logical. In werewolf you get to be the things that bumps back at these monsters. To use this camp in a way that was described on this thread, I feel it misses out on so much of what can be done.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":1179,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1179-celtspz","user":"CeltSPZ","date":". 10-10-2016, 03:34 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1179-celtspz","name":"CeltSPZ","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1179_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"835"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-10-10T13:38:52-07:00","id":985037,"title":"","content":"Personally, here is how I would use the Swords of Heimdall.<br /> <br /> They are still Gaian Garou, so if I were going to use them (which I never have but I may in the future) is to make them potential allies for the player characters. The PC's need to take on some important enemy (vampires, Pentex, BSD's, banes, etc.) and they need some help and the group in the best position to do so are some members of the Swords of Heimdall. Then the players are in an uncomfortable position of allying with this group while being outraged by many of their beliefs. Then we see how things go - maybe animosity turns violent and the PC's have two groups of enemies, maybe the players decide that they need to do it alone, maybe they overcome their differences and become friends, maybe the PC's try to convince the Sword of Heimdall (or at least one of them) to soften their ways.<br /> <br /> I think that the potential here is not in black vs white, but in showing things in shades of gray. So that the players get to do a bit of role playing and not just roll playing.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1129-sergeant-brother","name":"Sergeant Brother","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1129_3.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1620"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-10-10T14:59:19-07:00","id":985091,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>CeltSPZ</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-apocalypse-aa/984664-thread-of-fenris?p=984799#post984799\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> The problem is that these people aren't funny, ask any victim of a hate crime how funny they are. These sorts of people are dangerous, and through history have done some truly awful stuff (and yes I know you can find hatred and racism in all cultures, but the results are the same). So I guess I don't really look at them as &quot;comic relief&quot; due to the very real things people like them still due today.<br /> <a href=\"https://www.washingtonpost.com/news/post-nation/wp/2016/09/07/man-accused-of-running-down-black-teen-has-ties-to-a-white-supremacist-prison-gang-authorities-say/?0p19G=c&amp;utm_term=.eedc46c8f022\" target=\"_blank\">https://www.washingtonpost.com/news/...=.eedc46c8f022</a></div> </div> </div> </div>Fair point<br /> <br /> Do you see my point of view just curious that when their egoes are so oversized knocking them seems very tempting.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://imagizer.imageshack.us/a/img829/1897/8seg.png\" target=\"_blank\"><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://imagizer.imageshack.us/a/img829/1897/8seg.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"https://imageshack.com/i/2iw20supportergarou125p\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"https://imageshack.com/i/0j5hz8j\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /></a><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://imageshack.com/i/idnSdTJkj\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"https://i.imgsafe.org/97fd805379.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" />","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1153-prince-of-the-night","name":"Prince of the Night","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"4205"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-10-10T15:04:26-07:00","id":985094,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Prince of the Night</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-apocalypse-aa/984664-thread-of-fenris?p=985091#post985091\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Fair point<br /> <br /> Do you see my point of view just curious that when their egoes are so oversized knocking them seems very tempting.</div> </div> </div> </div><br /> Oh I get the appeal to kicking in their egos down several pegs. These are antagonists that people can love to hate, they're rather easy to dislike. However, isn't it more satisfying to take out these sorts of antagonists if they're done with a serious tone, and the threat is real? Writing them off as just &quot;losers&quot; means you miss out on really looking into what makes these people tick, and the ability to present a great antagonist, that can spawn some interesting engaging plots.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":1179,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1179-celtspz","user":"CeltSPZ","date":". 10-10-2016, 06:15 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1179-celtspz","name":"CeltSPZ","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1179_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"835"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-10-10T16:52:02-07:00","id":985129,"title":"","content":"You dont think that &quot;Losers&quot; Can exist amongst the supernatural? <br /> <br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://imagizer.imageshack.us/a/img829/1897/8seg.png\" target=\"_blank\"><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://imagizer.imageshack.us/a/img829/1897/8seg.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"https://imageshack.com/i/2iw20supportergarou125p\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"https://imageshack.com/i/0j5hz8j\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /></a><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://imageshack.com/i/idnSdTJkj\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"https://i.imgsafe.org/97fd805379.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" />","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1153-prince-of-the-night","name":"Prince of the Night","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"4205"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-10-10T17:21:41-07:00","id":985143,"title":"","content":"Oh I do, but to cast the whole camp into that category belittles the actual evil that they represent, as well as thier victims. After all saying that these guys are no true threat, then where do you rank the people (and other supernaturals who don't fit their ideal, remember non-white male homid garou are what this camp are against....can't remember if sexuality was involved as well) that are their victims?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":1179,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1179-celtspz","user":"CeltSPZ","date":". 10-10-2016, 08:47 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1179-celtspz","name":"CeltSPZ","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1179_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"835"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-10-10T18:15:46-07:00","id":985174,"title":"","content":"Ok fair point<br /> <br /> when I was still trying for a college degree, I checked out a book once on the NeoNazi movement.<br /> <br /> It said that Rockwell and some of his close colleagues found it difficult to tone down their propaganda so as to be accessible to the kinds of Morons that comprised their Rank and file<br /> <br /> He made a point of cutting out some of the more ridiculous forms of propaganda such as &quot;the brotherhood dictionary&quot; Viewing it as just making them look stupid, not of converting people to their POV.<br /> <br /> <br /> <br /> Wondering if the Swords would have the same kind of thing going on those who are losers who just happen to have super powers, wanting to give the finger to mommy and Daddy, and those who are much more dangerous and are &quot;True believers&quot;<br /> <br /> Ideas how they could interact, most obvious is the second using the First as canon fodder.<br /> <br /> any other ideas.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://imagizer.imageshack.us/a/img829/1897/8seg.png\" target=\"_blank\"><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://imagizer.imageshack.us/a/img829/1897/8seg.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"https://imageshack.com/i/2iw20supportergarou125p\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"https://imageshack.com/i/0j5hz8j\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /></a><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://imageshack.com/i/idnSdTJkj\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"https://i.imgsafe.org/97fd805379.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" />","edited":{"userid":1153,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1153-prince-of-the-night","user":"Prince of the Night","date":". 10-10-2016, 09:42 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1153-prince-of-the-night","name":"Prince of the Night","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"4205"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-10-10T18:52:19-07:00","id":985197,"title":"","content":"Well keep in mind, you can lack a lot of education, but still be rather resourceful/dangerous when you put your mind to it..and man hatred can be a big motivator for that. However I do think you're onto something about the True Believers and then wannabes. Another note, I found out while researching the Aryan Brotherhood for a sociology class...a lot of the big wigs of the movement aren't all that dedicated to the &quot;cause&quot;. A lot of them just use the true believers for their own ends, using hate to get what they want.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1179-celtspz","name":"CeltSPZ","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1179_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"835"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-10-10T19:03:17-07:00","id":985204,"title":"","content":"Oh heard in a book I read that such movements memberships generally are very sincere.<br /> <br /> Because in Nazi germany people joined the party to protect themselves, from losing their homes etc.<br /> <br /> In modern America (actually I think the book was written in the 60s or so) Its a good way to lose your Job.<br /> <br /> Well any idea on what the relationship between true believers and wannabes could look like beyond &quot;Cannon fodder&quot;","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://imagizer.imageshack.us/a/img829/1897/8seg.png\" target=\"_blank\"><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://imagizer.imageshack.us/a/img829/1897/8seg.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"https://imageshack.com/i/2iw20supportergarou125p\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"https://imageshack.com/i/0j5hz8j\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /></a><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://imageshack.com/i/idnSdTJkj\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"https://i.imgsafe.org/97fd805379.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" />","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1153-prince-of-the-night","name":"Prince of the Night","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"4205"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-10-10T19:05:25-07:00","id":985206,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Prince of the Night</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-apocalypse-aa/984664-thread-of-fenris?p=985174#post985174\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Ok fair point<br /> <br /> when I was still trying for a college degree, I checked out a book once on the NeoNazi movement.<br /> <br /> It said that Rockwell and some of his close colleagues found it difficult to tone down their propaganda so as to be accessible to the kinds of Morons that comprised their Rank and file<br /> <br /> He made a point of cutting out some of the more ridiculous forms of propaganda such as &quot;the brotherhood dictionary&quot; Viewing it as just making them look stupid, not of converting people to their POV.<br /> <br /> <br /> <br /> Wondering if the Swords would have the same kind of thing going on those who are losers who just happen to have super powers, wanting to give the finger to mommy and Daddy, and those who are much more dangerous and are &quot;True believers&quot;<br /> <br /> Ideas how they could interact, most obvious is the second using the First as canon fodder.<br /> <br /> any other ideas.</div> </div> </div> </div>Garou and kinfolk culture is so radically different from modern human culture that the reasons for becoming a Neo Nazi would surely be different. <br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1129-sergeant-brother","name":"Sergeant Brother","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1129_3.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1620"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-10-10T19:12:27-07:00","id":985210,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Prince of the Night</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-apocalypse-aa/984664-thread-of-fenris?p=985174#post985174\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Ok fair point<br /> <br /> when I was still trying for a college degree, I checked out a book once on the NeoNazi movement.<br /> <br /> It said that Rockwell and some of his close colleagues found it difficult to tone down their propaganda so as to be accessible to the kinds of Morons that comprised their Rank and file<br /> <br /> He made a point of cutting out some of the more ridiculous forms of propaganda such as &quot;the brotherhood dictionary&quot; Viewing it as just making them look stupid, not of converting people to their POV.<br /> <br /> <br /> <br /> Wondering if the Swords would have the same kind of thing going on those who are losers who just happen to have super powers, wanting to give the finger to mommy and Daddy, and those who are much more dangerous and are &quot;True believers&quot;<br /> <br /> Ideas how they could interact, most obvious is the second using the First as canon fodder.<br /> <br /> any other ideas.</div> </div> </div> </div>And racist ideology is stupid on its head, being based ultimately on the four humors, but look at how far Trump has gotten with his racist dog whistling.<br /> <br /> Setting that aside, however, the Swords are, like the other Aesir-named camps, an example of something that shouldn't exist anymore. Doubly so on account of it taking a Stormfront-based standpoint on what Heimdall represents, as reflected in the BAW that such folk had when Idris Elba played him in Thor. If the &quot;whitest god&quot; is one of your hated enemies, well, anyone trying to claim allegiance is going to be brought to heel or killed in short order per standard practice of the tribe.<br /> <br /> Garou blood is what they value, and it can be cultivated in any group of humans. Leave the human racist ideologies to humans that created them.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/23-saur-ops-specialist","name":"Saur Ops Specialist","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar23_3.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"9371"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-10-10T20:51:48-07:00","id":985254,"title":"","content":"You know what would be interesting?<br /> <br /> If we took all of those Aesir-themed camps and made them hunter organizations that clashed with the Fenrir across time. And one of those could be the Swords, and part of their driving motivation could be that they see the Get of Fenris as tainting their blood, because werewolves are clearly not human.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/23-saur-ops-specialist","name":"Saur Ops Specialist","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar23_3.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"9371"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-10-11T09:19:19-07:00","id":985461,"title":"","content":"Hmmmn came up with a group of crazys KIND of like them once the &quot;Children of humanity&quot; <br /> <br /> a bunch of Homosapien purists.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://imagizer.imageshack.us/a/img829/1897/8seg.png\" target=\"_blank\"><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://imagizer.imageshack.us/a/img829/1897/8seg.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"https://imageshack.com/i/2iw20supportergarou125p\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"https://imageshack.com/i/0j5hz8j\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /></a><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://imageshack.com/i/idnSdTJkj\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"https://i.imgsafe.org/97fd805379.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" />","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1153-prince-of-the-night","name":"Prince of the Night","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"4205"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-10-11T13:16:46-07:00","id":985623,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Prince of the Night</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-apocalypse-aa/984664-thread-of-fenris?p=985461#post985461\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Hmmmn came up with a group of crazys KIND of like them once the &amp;quot;Children of humanity&amp;quot; <br /> <br /> a bunch of Homosapien purists.</div> </div> </div> </div>Though, I don't think you'd have to be som kind of hate group or care about genetic purity to hunt werewolves. I mean, you could I guess, but the differences between werewolf and human (much less the justifucations for killing them) go so far beyond race that it doesn't seem that connected. Like a Nazi who works for Orkin because insects aren't Aryans - technically true but still pretty strange.<br /> <br /> I think it might be interesting to have groups of werewolves who have joined the Wyrm but serve it as a reflection of their old Tribe's ideology. For example, fallen Get of Fenris who venerate the Aesir as powerful servants of the Wyrm.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1129-sergeant-brother","name":"Sergeant Brother","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1129_3.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1620"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-10-11T18:08:41-07:00","id":985831,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Sergeant Brother</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-apocalypse-aa/984664-thread-of-fenris?p=985623#post985623\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> Though, I don't think you'd have to be som kind of hate group or care about genetic purity to hunt werewolves. I mean, you could I guess, but the differences between werewolf and human (much less the justifucations for killing them) go so far beyond race that it doesn't seem that connected. Like a Nazi who works for Orkin because insects aren't Aryans - technically true but still pretty strange.</div> </div> </div> </div>Insects don't shapeshift into humans and start families with them, though, or congregate in secret societies.<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> I think it might be interesting to have groups of werewolves who have joined the Wyrm but serve it as a reflection of their old Tribe's ideology. For example, fallen Get of Fenris who venerate the Aesir as powerful servants of the Wyrm. </div> </div> </div>That could also work.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/23-saur-ops-specialist","name":"Saur Ops Specialist","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar23_3.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"9371"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-10-11T18:13:37-07:00","id":985835,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Sergeant Brother</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-apocalypse-aa/984664-thread-of-fenris?p=985623#post985623\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> Though, I don't think you'd have to be som kind of hate group or care about genetic purity to hunt werewolves. I mean, you could I guess, but the differences between werewolf and human (much less the justifucations for killing them) go so far beyond race that it doesn't seem that connected. Like a Nazi who works for Orkin because insects aren't Aryans - technically true but still pretty strange.<br /> <br /> I think it might be interesting to have groups of werewolves who have joined the Wyrm but serve it as a reflection of their old Tribe's ideology. For example, fallen Get of Fenris who venerate the Aesir as powerful servants of the Wyrm.</div> </div> </div> </div><br /> Had wondered for a bit if their were Cultists similar to Forsakens Balehounds, prior to the fall of the howlers.<br /> <br /> Not really &quot;Into&quot; forsaken myself, and a lot of the talk of it being &quot;An improvement on WTA&quot; Drives me away.<br /> <br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://imagizer.imageshack.us/a/img829/1897/8seg.png\" target=\"_blank\"><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://imagizer.imageshack.us/a/img829/1897/8seg.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"https://imageshack.com/i/2iw20supportergarou125p\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"https://imageshack.com/i/0j5hz8j\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /></a><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://imageshack.com/i/idnSdTJkj\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"https://i.imgsafe.org/97fd805379.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" />","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachme